  "notes": "R3 000 a week, under 65, week Mon-Sun paid on the Sunday: 1 March 2026 and 28 February 2027 are both Sundays, so tax year 2027 has 53 pay days (no 2027 year has 53 Fridays, and 2027 is the only table year the engine has). Week 53 = 22-28 Feb 2027, after 52 weekly priors. Expected = SimplePay’s documented averaging (YTD x 52 / periods worked): the annual equivalent stays 156 000, tax 10 260, YTD tax 10 260 / 52 x 53, so week 53 = 197.31, the same as every week. UNVERIFIED: G21 p. 9 says x total pay periods in the tax year, which in a 53-week year would be x53 (203.77 a week); the weekly tables use x52; Sage counts 52 or 53 periods. UIF 30.00; net 3 000 - 197.31 - 30.00.",
